        "Synthetic data, 240 review charts: **not clinical performance**. *vs truth* is the README's number (the generator's answer key); *vs judge* scores the same answers against an LLM judge's own reading of each note (**LLM judgment**, on the charts it gave a status for). The gap shows how far the judge could stand in for an answer key on real notes. Metric names as in the README.\n"
